          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova amwĩa Samueli, Ĩthukĩĩsye wasya woo, na ũimaiĩa mũsumbĩ. Na Samueli amea andũ ma Isilaeli, Endai kĩla mũndũ ndũanĩ kwoo. ",
          "type": "text",
